function renderFacilities(){$('#facilities-copy').textContent=t(hall===1?'hall1Facilities':'hall2Facilities');for(const c of['blue','orange','yellow'])$(`#${c}-count`).textContent=stalls.filter(s=>s.hall===hall&&s.color===c).length;$('#purple-legend').hidden=hall!==1;}
function renderDirectory(){const focused=document.activeElement?.dataset.stall;const query=$('#stall-search').value.trim(),cat=$('#category').value;const list=stalls.filter(s=>s.hall===hall&&(!query||String(s.n).includes(query)||(query==='198'&&s.n===149))&&(cat==='all'||s.tier===cat));$('#result-count').textContent=`${list.length} ${t('results')}`;$('#stall-directory').innerHTML=list.length?list.map(s=>`<button data-stall="${s.n}" style="--stall-color:${colors[s.color]}" class="${selected?.n===s.n?'selected':''}" aria-pressed="${selected?.n===s.n}" aria-label="${t('hall')} ${hall}, ${t('stall')} ${s.n}, ${t(s.tier)}, ${money(s.price)}">${s.n}${s.n===149?'*':''}<span class="directory-booked" aria-hidden="true" ${bookings.isBooked(s.n)?'':'hidden'}>✓</span></button>`).join(''):`<p class="empty">${t('noResults')}</p>`;$('#stall-directory').querySelectorAll('[data-stall]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>selectStall(b.dataset.stall,{reveal:true}));if(focused)$(`[data-stall="${focused}"]`)?.focus({preventScroll:true});syncDirectoryBookings();explorer?.filter(cat);renderFlat();}
function switchHall(n){selectionIntent++;enquiryIntent++;enquiryOpening=false;selectionChecking=false;$('#scene-wrap').dataset.bookingChecking='false';hall=Number(n);selected=null;stopAutoUI();showHover(null);$$('[data-hall]').forEach(b=>{const active=Number(b.dataset.hall)===hall;b.classList.toggle('active',active);b.setAttribute('aria-selected',active);b.tabIndex=active?0:-1;});$('#stall-search').value='';$('#search-go').disabled=true;$('#category').value='all';plan?.setHall(hall);explorer?.setHall(hall);explorer?.setBookings(bookings.booked,bookings.statuses);plan?.setBookings(bookings.booked,bookings.statuses);explorer?.setDirections(directions);renderCategories();renderDetail();renderFacilities();renderDirectory();renderFlat();updateSelectionPin();$('#scene-title').textContent=`${t('hall')} ${hall} · ${halls[hall].count} ${t('stallCount')}`;}
